Foz
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
OBA 3 FACE_ALL
OBA 7 FACE_HALF

HIDIR 7 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
HIDIR 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
HIDIR 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE OBA HIDIR
DESTSRC Rank equal
MOVE_STACK HIDIR OBA
DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK OBA {HIDIR, OBA}
DEST Size <= 7
$win
PILE ALL OBA Empty
